# Bonus A: Idempotency
# Change @key for each new experiment; reuse it to see a replay.
@host = https://localhost:7001
@dana = paste-dana-token-here
@erin = paste-erin-token-here
@key = 7f3c9a2e-first-try

### Create with a key: 201
POST {{host}}/api/v1/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{dana}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{key}}

{ "title": "Printer on fire", "description": "Third floor.", "priority": "High", "requesterId": "carol" }

### Exactly the same again: the same 201, plus Idempotent-Replayed: true
POST {{host}}/api/v1/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{dana}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{key}}

{ "title": "Printer on fire", "description": "Third floor.", "priority": "High", "requesterId": "carol" }

### Same key, different body: 422 idempotency-key-reused
POST {{host}}/api/v1/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{dana}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{key}}

{ "title": "Coffee machine on fire", "description": "Kitchen.", "priority": "High", "requesterId": "carol" }

### Same key, another user: a different ticket (keys belong to the caller)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{erin}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{key}}

{ "title": "Printer on fire", "description": "Third floor.", "priority": "High", "requesterId": "carol" }

### A key that's too long: 400 idempotency-key-invalid
POST {{host}}/api/v1/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{dana}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: kkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkk

{ "title": "Printer on fire", "description": "Third floor.", "priority": "High", "requesterId": "carol" }

### Slow the store to 3 seconds, then send the create twice, quickly: the second is a 409
PUT {{host}}/dev/chaos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "latencyMs": 3000, "errorRate": 0, "available": true }

###
POST {{host}}/dev/chaos/reset
